    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      495.67,
      286.03,
      530.74
    ],
    "text": "Name of Local Authority : Eravur Urban CouncilName of Ward : PalliyadiGrama Niladhari Division : 191 A - Eravur 2 A",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      542.67,
      549.65,
      564.74
    ],
    "text": "W\u0d81\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d7a\u0d8c Eravur was declared an Urban Council area by virtue of Extraordinary Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 1687/23 dated 05.01.2011 published by the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      575.67,
      549.66,
      597.74
    ],
    "text": "W\u0d81\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d7a\u0d8c it is necessary to give e\ufb00 ect to the provisions contained in part III of the Urban Council Ordinance Chapter 255 of 1939,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      608.67,
      549.71,
      652.74
    ],
    "text": "W\u0d81\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d7a\u0d8c the Urban Development Authority Regulations issued by the Hon. Minister of Urban Development and Housingunder section 8 of the Urban Development Authority (Amendment) Act, No. 4 of 1982, and Section 21 of the Urban Development Authority Act, No. 41 of 1978 of the National Assembly, as published in the Extraordinary Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 2235/54 dated 08.07.2021, are applicable hereto,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      663.67,
      549.68,
      696.74
    ],
    "text": "A\u0d87\u0d7d \u0d90\u0d81\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d7a\u0d8c the Council duly adopted at its Monthly General Meetings by Resolution No. EUC/GM- 03/2025 - AUG/13 dated 28.08.2025 held on Thursday and by Resolution No. EUC/GM - 07/2025 - DEC/20 dated 18.12.2025 held on Thursday, resolved to declare the road described in the Schedule hereto,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      707.67,
      549.69,
      751.74
    ],
    "text": "N\u0d88\u0d90 \u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d7f\u0d88\u0d8b\u0d7e, I hereby declare that the road more fully described in the Schedule below, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division No. 191 A Eravur 2A, in the Palliyadi Ward, and falling within the administrative jurisdiction of the Eravur Urban Council, shall be and is hereby declared to be a public road vested in and maintained by the Eravur Urban Council in terms of the aforesaid laws.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.61,
      759.95,
      300.63,
      780.61
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 PG7541\u2013 04 (02/2026)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
